# cycle started. The same paths are re-hashed after the browser runs and
# required equal, so this file is a freeze of what produced the artifacts in
# browser-agent/ — not a description of the working tree at any later moment.
# A re-freeze without a re-run would silently change that meaning, so both are
# always done together.
